                            <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                                General, restorative, endodontic (root canal), and prosthetic dental assessments and procedures at our Nairobi &amp; Thika clinics.
                            </p>
                            <span class="small fw-semibold text-primary mt-auto">Profile &amp; Qualifications Coming Soon</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Role Placeholder 2 -->
