                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                                    We take time to examine your teeth and gums carefully and explain our clinical findings in plain, understandable language before treatment starts.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="why-team-box">
                                <i class="bi bi-heart-pulse-fill"></i>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-2">Patient-Centered Comfort</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                                    We value comfort, clear communication, and respectful care for every patient—whether it is a child's check-up or an adult restorative procedure.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-4">
